DLSS5 Phoenix portable runtime source subset
-------------------------------------------
Derived from dlssnr-pytorch (https://github.com/mauri870/dlssnr-pytorch).
Copyright (c) 2026 Mauri de Souza Meneguzzo. MIT License; see LICENSE.

DLSS5 Phoenix adaptations retain runtime tensor access and layout conversion,
remove the upstream weight-file storage API, and split the in-memory tensor
layout helpers from the upstream extraction module. The upstream extraction
module, its command-line tools, weights and NVIDIA binaries are not included.
See PROVENANCE.md for the reference revision and file-level changes.

Source cleanup (2026-10-11): the former Python runtime modules are no longer
included. This attribution and the MIT license remain for the layout
declarations adapted into native_runtime/weight_layouts.h. The adaptation
history below describes the earlier source subset.

DLSS5 Phoenix readability refresh (2026-10-10): locally formatted runtime
source and added operation/formatting comments. Original attribution and
license text are retained. See PROVENANCE.md for the recorded origin.
